    rdf:value """Sunday, Mar. 22, 1908 
Iffley.
Fierce Rain.
Walked over to Bagley Wood and had lunch with Alys and Bertie. Gilbert Murray came in the afternoon. Karin walked over and came back with me."""^^xsd:string ;
